{"id":560,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"While mostly known for having the temperament of an aggressive ruffian, this Pokémon takes very good care of its family, friends, and territory."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"As halfhearted as this Pokémon’s kicks may seem, they pack enough power to shatter Conkeldurr’s concrete pillars."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"It taunts its opponents by spitting. It has a certain territory that it never leaves its whole life long."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"This Pokémon may be rude, but it takes very good care of its family, its friends, and its turf."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","White"],"text":"It can smash concrete blocks with its kicking attacks. The one with the biggest crest is the group leader."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","White 2","Black 2"],"text":"It pulls up its shed skin to protect itself while it kicks. The bigger the crest, the more respected it is."},{"games":["Black"],"text":"Groups of them beat up anything that enters their territory. Each can spit acidic liquid from its mouth."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Shed Skin","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon may cure its own status conditions by shedding its skin."},{"name":"Moxie","hidden":false,"description":"When the Pokémon knocks out a target, it shows moxie, which boosts its Attack stat."},{"name":"Intimidate","hidden":true,"description":"When the Pokémon enters a battle, it intimidates opposing Pokémon and makes them cower, lowering their Attack stats."}],"eggGroups":["Field","Dragon"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":null,"color":"Red","shape":"Upright","evolution":{"id":559,"name":"Scraggy","condition":null,"children":[{"id":560,"name":"Scrafty","condition":"Lv. 39","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,29],[1,43],[1,67],[1,371],[12,28],[16,263],[20,259],[24,251],[28,184],[32,280],[36,207],[42,242],[48,136],[54,264],[60,457]],"machine":[491,133,34,280,339,370,811,242,